</div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Set the Standard in Karnal</h2>\n            <p>Clients in Karnal now compare local salons with what they see on trips to Delhi and Chandigarh. A capable salon interior designer helps you match that standard close to home.</p><p>Planning a salon in Karnal? <a href=\"/karnal/contact\">Call 9th Corner</a> to discuss your shop.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}